<title>POLAND: PAGED RECEIVES PLN 2.4 MLN TAX REFUND.</title>
<headline>PAGED RECEIVES PLN 2.4 MLN TAX REFUND.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tax authorities of Warsaw's central municipality awarded Polish wood and furniture trader Paged SA 2.4 million zlotys in interest on overpaid income taxes from 1989 and 1990, Paged said in a Thursday statement.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
